    {
      "heading": "Question and aim",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "Start with a research question you can answer with data.",
          "write": "research question"
        },
        {
          "say": "How does acid concentration affect the hydrogen made per minute?",
          "write": "[HCl] vs H₂ per minute"
        },
        {
          "say": "The aim matches it. To investigate the effect of concentration on rate.",
          "write": "To investigate…"
        },
        {
          "say": "To see what happens is too vague. Say what changes and what you measure.",
          "write": "✗ To see what happens"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Hypothesis",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "A hypothesis is a testable prediction, with a reason.",
          "write": "testable prediction"
        },
        {
          "say": "If, then, because.",
          "write": "If… then… because…",
          "draw": {
            "type": "shapes",
            "width": 560,
            "height": 300,
            "alt": "Hypothesis parts",
            "items": [
              {
                "kind": "rect",
                "x": 20,
                "y": 90,
                "w": 160,
                "h": 80,
                "fill": "blue",
                "label": "If [IV] changes"
